    <string name="safety_title">Wallet security · %1$d/2</string>
    <string name="safety_question_1">Someone claiming to be the Q-BitX team asks for your seed phrase. What should you do?</string>
    <string name="safety_question_2">If I lose my seed phrase and every wallet.dat backup, who can restore my access?</string>
    <string name="safety_wrong_1">Yes, I must provide my seed phrase</string>
    <string name="safety_right_1">No, they are scammers</string>
    <string name="safety_wrong_2">The Q-BitX team can recover my wallet and funds</string>
    <string name="safety_right_2">The team cannot recover my access</string>
    <string name="safety_explanation_1">The Q-BitX team will never ask for your seed phrase or wallet.dat file. Anyone asking for them is a scammer.</string>
    <string name="safety_explanation_2">The Q-BitX team has no access to your wallets or recovery backups. If every copy of your seed, keys and recovery files is lost, access to your funds is lost forever.</string>
